== Events ==
=== Event Benden ===
When the player enters the Cotton Tunnel from the [[Dragon's Cave]].

[[Dragonrider]] Benden:
* It... escaped! Drokoro is free! Perhaps... Perhaps it'll find a place where it can grow strong, where it can truly be itself. There is still hope. (if the player doesn't capture [[Drokoro]])
* You... You captured it. Know this, though: the path to becoming a true Dragonrider has begun. You'll face many challenges, many trials. But if you're worthy, you'll find your own path to balance, your own way to protect this land. (if the player captures [[Drokoro]])
then, no matter the result
* We, the Dragonriders, will retreat to [[Lion Mountain]]. There, we'll watch over this land from afar, hoping that the balance can somehow be restored.

